# #487 (0.9.0 road test): Settings > Language > 日本語 while a song plays,
# then a song opened from the Songs list. On the device that panicked:
# "audio_reset_buffer(): OOM!". The language block, pinned, was cut off
# the playing buffer's end by #170's reserve take; the song's cold start
# freed the buffer and core_alloc_maximum() asked for the whole hole in
# front of the pinned block, with no room for the new block's header.
#
# Now (owner, first-hand: the 7G's language change) the switch stops
# playback, settles (the strings, the CJK glyph tier and pin, each timed,
# under the header's busy glyph, nothing owed to a quiet moment and no
# allocation from the playing buffer), and lands on the main menu in
# Japanese with the music stopped. A song from the list then plays.
# Red: the base (cef8d8f937, neither fix): the OOM panic at the song
# from the list. The allocator fix alone: the song plays, but the switch
# keeps playing and owes the tier ("cjk tier owed").
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p20-lang-ja-playing.script
# needs: library
# needs: npinfo
# needs: cjk
# timeout: 180
# golden: skip
# env: IPODUI_SIM_NOTICE=clear
# log: language set japanese rc=0
# logbetween: p0 p1 lang settle stop was=1
# logbetween: p0 p1 lang settle strings rc=0 ms=
# logbetween: p0 p1 cjk settle tier=1 apply ms=\d+ pin ms=\d+
# logbetween: p0 p1 cjk pin glyphs=
# logbetween: p0 p1 lang settle done japanese ms=
# logbetween: p0 p1 settle glyph phase=
# logbetween: p0 p1 vlist to root
# logbetween: p0 p1 no cjk tier owed
# logbetween: p0 p1 no audio reserve take
# logbetween: p0 p1 no audio shrink want=\d+ status=[1-9]
# logbetween: p1 p2 expect_playing ok
# log: expect_stopped ok
# nolog: expect_stopped failed
# nolog: expect_playing failed
# nolog: OOM
# nolog: ipodui: fit cut

wait 4000
key SELECT           # the first-boot notice (unacknowledged): dismiss
wait 1500
wait_db 30000
repeat one
mkdir /NPINFO
copy ../../build/npinfo-fixtures/cd16.mp3 /NPINFO/cd16.mp3
play_files /NPINFO/cd16.mp3
wait 1500
expect_playing 300
key MENU             # Now Playing (pushed by the play) -> main menu
wait 1200
wheel -10            # the first row
wait 500
wheel +3             # Settings (4th main-menu row)
wait 500
key SELECT
wait 1500
wheel +5             # Settings rows: About 0 ... Language 15 of 18
wait 500
wheel +5
wait 500
wheel +5             # Language
wait 800
key SELECT
wait 1500
ab_mark p0
wheel +3             # 日本語 (English, Deutsch, Nederlands, 日本語)
wait 600
key SELECT
wait 3000
shot switched        # the main menu in Japanese, the music stopped
expect_stopped
ab_mark p1
wheel -10            # the first row: Music
wait 500
key SELECT
wait 1000
wheel +3             # Songs
wait 500
key SELECT
wait 2000
shot songs
audio_regrow         # a freed block (art, library), as on the device
# (audio_regrow: the next cold start sizes the buffer, audio_reset_buffer)
key SELECT           # the first song: that cold start
wait 2500
expect_playing 3000
ab_mark p2
shot playing
audio_stop
wait 1000
lang_set -
quit
